{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"983","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Finite or not?"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given several queries. Each query consists of three integers $$$p$$$, $$$q$$$ and $$$b$$$. You need to answer whether the result of $$$p/q$$$ in notation with base $$$b$$$ is a finite fraction."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A fraction in notation with base $$$b$$$ is finite if it contains finite number of numerals after the decimal point. It is also possible that a fraction has zero numerals after the decimal point."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$) — the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next $$$n$$$ lines contain queries, one per line. Each line contains three integers $$$p$$$, $$$q$$$, and $$$b$$$ ($$$0 \\le p \\le 10^{18}$$$, $$$1 \\le q \\le 10^{18}$$$, $$$2 \\le b \\le 10^{18}$$$). All numbers are given in notation with base $$$10$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each question, in a separate line, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Finite"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if the fraction is finite and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Infinite"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" otherwise."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2\n6 12 10\n4 3 10\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Finite\nInfinite\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4\n1 1 2\n9 36 2\n4 12 3\n3 5 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"Finite\nFinite\nFinite\nInfinite\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\frac{6}{12} = \\frac{1}{2} = 0,5_{10}$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\frac{4}{3} = 1,(3)_{10}$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\frac{9}{36} = \\frac{1}{4} = 0,01_2$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\frac{4}{12} = \\frac{1}{3} = 0,1_3$$$ "}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"983A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/983/problem/A"}